msgid "Rooms are allocated. Living together is negotiated."
msgstr "部屋は配分できても、生活は一緒に協議する。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Compare five residences and record needs around moon phase, wingspan, water, "
"familiars, and sleep. The housing committee returns three room offers with "
"both the fit and the likely arguments in writing."
msgstr "五つの寮を比較し、月相・翼幅・水域・使い魔・生活時間を申告。寮務委員会が三案を示し、合う点と揉めそうな点を両方明記します。"

