msgstr "完全な遮月設備なし"

#. copy/frictions/waterMissing
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/waterMissing"
msgid "No direct water connection"
msgstr "水域へ直結しない"

#. copy/frictions/wingTight
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/wingTight"
msgid "Limited turning space for large wings"
msgstr "大翼幅の転回が狭い"

#. copy/frictions/phaseUnmarked
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/phaseUnmarked"
msgid "No marked safe wall passage"
msgstr "安全な壁抜け標線なし"

#. copy/frictions/familiarCrowded
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/familiarCrowded"
msgid "Tight space for a large familiar"
msgstr "大型使い魔区画が狭い"

#. copy/frictions/danmakuOutside
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/danmakuOutside"
msgid "Danmaku practice must move outdoors"
msgstr "弾幕練習は屋外"

#. copy/frictions/roomTypeDifferent
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/roomTypeDifferent"
msgid "Not the requested room type"
msgstr "希望室種と異なる"

#. copy/frictions/overBudget
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/frictions/overBudget"
msgid "Above the stated fee ceiling"
msgstr "申告月額を超える"

#. copy/incidents/doorName
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/doorName"
msgid ""
"The sign must show both names and the room number. If the number changes "
"itself, use the names."
msgstr "表札には室番号と両名を併記。室番号が変化した場合は氏名を優先。"

#. copy/incidents/singleVisitor
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/singleVisitor"
msgid ""
"A single-room guest may not stay beyond three nights as a “temporary "
"roommate”; on night four they receive a bed application."
msgstr "一人室の来客は「臨時同室者」として三泊を超えられない。四泊目に寝床申請票を渡す。"

#. copy/incidents/quietHours
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/quietHours"
msgid "Sleep hours differ. Post daily quiet hours on the door; change them before dinner."
msgstr "睡眠時間が異なるため、毎日の静音時間を扉へ記載。変更は夕食前まで。"

#. copy/incidents/nightKitchen
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/nightKitchen"
msgid "Keep one red lamp on during late kitchen use. Do not use a saucepan as an alarm."
msgstr "深夜厨房は赤灯を一本残し、鍋を目覚ましにしない。"

#. copy/incidents/fullMoon
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/fullMoon"
msgid ""
"For three nights around the full moon, low-stimulus needs take priority; the "
"lounge absorbs the other resident’s activity."
msgstr "満月前後三夜は低刺激を要する側を優先。活動量は談話室で受け止める。"

#. copy/incidents/familiarChair
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/familiarChair"
msgid ""
"Familiars and furniture are not first come, first served. Redraw the "
"window-chair rota weekly."
msgstr "使い魔と家具は早い者勝ちでない。窓辺椅子の表を毎週更新。"

#. copy/incidents/wallKnock
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/wallKnock"
msgid ""
"Knock three times before phasing. Whether it is a wall or door does not "
"alter the number three."
msgstr "壁抜け前に三回ノック。壁か扉かに関係なく三回。"

#. copy/incidents/waterSchedule
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/waterSchedule"
msgid ""
"Clear the room channel at 06:00 daily. Personal objects may not be renamed "
"“temporary waterworks.”"
msgstr "室内水路は毎日06:00清障。私物を「仮設水利」と呼ばない。"

#. copy/incidents/windowRunway
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/windowRunway"
msgid ""
"Keep the window take-off line clear. The wider wingspan tests the "
"clothesline height first."
msgstr "窓辺の離陸線を空け、物干し高は翼幅の大きい側が試す。"

#. copy/incidents/danmakuTape
#: src/js/housing.js:32
msgctxt "tree:copy#/incidents/danmakuTape"
msgid ""
"Only the area inside red tape is blast-resistant. Moving the tape does not "
"enlarge the room."
msgstr "赤テープ内のみ耐爆区画。テープを動かしても部屋は広がらない。"

